    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/interactive-education/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Interactive Education theme is a versatile and feature-rich solution designed for educators, schools, colleges, universities, online academies, training institutes, and e-learning platforms. Built with modern educational needs in mind, it is ideal for online education, distance learning, virtual classrooms, K-12 schools, STEM education, skill development courses, professional training, test preparation, language learning, and coaching centers. Perfect for managing online course platforms, university portals, and private tutoring services, this theme supports LMS functionality through LearnPress plugin integration, offering interactive learning modules, student dashboards, and advanced course management tools. It includes sections for course listings, instructor profiles, student testimonials, academic blogs, and program highlights, making it suitable for higher education institutions, digital academies, and certification programs. With a responsive, mobile-friendly design and accessibility-ready features, it ensures seamless usability across all devices for remote learners. The theme’s customization options let users personalize layouts, colors, and typography to match institutional branding. SEO-optimized code, fast performance, multilingual support, and compatibility with online learning tools enhance visibility and global reach. Whether you’re building an e-learning site, virtual school, training portal, or educational marketplace, Interactive Education offers a dynamic, engaging, and user-friendly platform to deliver high-quality digital education experiences."
    },
